pan></p><h1 style="font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:bold;color:#1B2559;margin:16px 0 8px">&lt;b&gt;Hi&lt;/b&gt; &amp; &quot;you&quot;</h1><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#475569;margin:0 0 4px">Two quick changes and your profile can be verified.</p><div style="height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;background-color:#E6EAF2;margin:20px 0"> </div><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#334155;margin:0 0 14px">Line &lt;script&gt;x&lt;/script&gt;</p><ul style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;margin:0 0 14px;padding:0;padding-left:22px"><li style="margin:0 0 6px"><strong>bold</strong> item</li></ul><div style="margin:20px 0;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background-color:#F8FAFC;border:1px solid #E6EAF2"><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 4px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em;font-weight:bold">Ticket</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#1B2559;margin:0">SAP FI posting error</p><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#475569;margin:6px 0 0">#1A2B3C4D · Status: in progress</p></div><div style="margin:20px 0;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background-color:#FFFBEB;border:1px solid #FDE68A"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#92400E;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em">What you need to do</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#451A03;margin:0">Update your profile</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#451A03;margin:0;margin-top:6px;font-weight:bold">Deadline: Fri, 6 Nov 2026</p></div><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" width="auto" align="left" style="margin:26px 0 0"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor="#1B2559" style="background-color:#1B2559;border-radius:12px"><a href="https://www.aisupport360.com/consultant/profile" style="display:inline-block;padding:15px 30px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Reply in the portal</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:14px 0 0"><a href="https://www.aisupport360.com/notifications" style="color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline">View all notifications</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:22px 28px 26px"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#64748b;margin:0;border-top:1px solid #E6EAF2;padding-top:16px">Sent by the AI Support 360 team (admin) · 30 Oct 2026, 12:40 UTC</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F7F9FC" style="background-color:#F7F9FC;padding:22px 28px 24px;border-top:1px solid #E6EAF2;border-radius:0 0 18px 18px" data-part="footer"><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#334155;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:bold">Need help? Reply in the portal, or write to <a href="mailto:info@aisupport360.com" style="color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline">info@aisupport360.com</a></p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 6px">To answer, open the portal with the button above. Replies to this e-mail are not read.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 6px">You receive this because an AI Support 360 administrator sent you this message in the portal. <a href="https://www.aisupport360.com/notifications/pause" style="color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline">Notification settings</a></p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#94a3b8;margin:12px 0 0">AI Support 360 · <a href="https://www.aisupport360.com" style="color:#94a3b8;text-decoration:underline">www.aisupport360.com</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"`;

exports[`review decisions — one shared sender and layout > decision e-mail HTML snapshot (EN, comment quote, next steps) 1`] = `"<html lang="en" dir="ltr"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"/><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark"/><title>Your certificate is no longer verified</title></head><body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%"><div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;font-size:1px;line-height:1px">Your certificate is no longer verified</div><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" width="100%" bgcolor="#F1F4F9" style="background-color:#F1F4F9"><tbody><tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px"><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" width="600" align="center" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #E6EAF2;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;direction:ltr;text-align:left"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor="#072B5A" style="background-color:#072B5A;padding:22px 28px;border-radius:18px 18px 0 0;text-align:left"><img src="https://www.aisupport360.com/__l5e/assets-v1/94a9cd20-ec56-41c9-897e-534889a80659/brand-navy.png" width="160" height="36" alt="AI Support 360" style="display:inline-block;border:0;outline:none;width:160px;height:36px;max-width:100%"/></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#3B82F6" height="4" style="height:4px;font-size:0;line-height:0;background-color:#3B82F6;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#072B5A,#3B82F6)"> </td></tr><tr><td style="padding:30px 28px 6px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><p style="margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.03em;color:#1B2559;background-color:#E0E7FF">Decision</span><span style="display:inline-block;margin-left:6px;padding:4px 11px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#92400E;background-color:#FEF3C7;border:1px solid #92400E33">Needs changes</span></p><h1 style="font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:bold;color:#1B2559;margin:16px 0 8px">Your certificate is no longer verified</h1><div style="height:1px;line-height:1px;font-size:1px;background-color:#E6EAF2;margin:20px 0"> </div><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#334155;margin:0 0 14px">After a review, the verified mark on your certificate was removed.</p><div style="margin:18px 0;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background-color:#EFF6FF;border-left:4px solid #3B82F6"><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#1D4ED8;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em">Comment from the administrator</p><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#1e293b;margin:0">The file is unreadable.</p></div><div style="margin:18px 0;padding:16px 18px;border-radius:14px;background-color:#F8FAFC;border:1px solid #CBD5E1"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#1B2559;margin:0 0 6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em">What you need to do next</p><ol style="font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#334155;margin:0;padding:0;padding-left:22px"><li style="margin:0 0 6px">Read the comment above.</li><li style="margin:0 0 6px">Correct or upload the item again in your profile.</li><li style="margin:0 0 6px">We will check it again.</li></ol></div><table role="presentation" cellPadding="0" cellSpacing="0" border="0" width="auto" align="left" style="margin:26px 0 0"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor="#1B2559" style="background-color:#1B2559;border-radius:12px"><a href="https://www.aisupport360.com/consultant/verification" style="display:inline-block;padding:15px 30px;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:12px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif">Open your profile</a></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="font-size:14px;line-height:20px;margin:14px 0 0"><a href="https://www.aisupport360.com/notifications" style="color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline">View all notifications</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:22px 28px 26px"><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#64748b;margin:0;border-top:1px solid #E6EAF2;padding-top:16px">Sent by the AI Support 360 team (admin) · 30 Oct 2026, 12:40 UTC</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#F7F9FC" style="background-color:#F7F9FC;padding:22px 28px 24px;border-top:1px solid #E6EAF2;border-radius:0 0 18px 18px" data-part="footer"><p style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#334155;margin:0 0 8px;font-weight:bold">Need help? Reply in the portal, or write to <a href="mailto:info@aisupport360.com" style="color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline">info@aisupport360.com</a></p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 6px">To answer, open the portal with the button above. Replies to this e-mail are not read.</p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#64748b;margin:0 0 6px">You receive this because an AI Support 360 administrator sent you this message in the portal. <a href="https://www.aisupport360.com/notifications/pause" style="color:#2563EB;text-decoration:underline">Notification settings</a></p><p style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#94a3b8;margin:12px 0 0">AI Support 360 · <a href="https://www.aisupport360.com" style="color:#94a3b8;text-decoration:underline">www.aisupport360.com</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>"`;
